{"step":5,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731","prompt":"","response":"The points cells (F,H,J,L,N) return text values from the IF formulas, which is why SUM doesn't work. I'll write a formula that converts each to a number and sums them.\n\n","input_tokens":81270,"output_tokens":635,"latency_ms":9148,"error":null,"tool":"bash","tool_input":{"command":"cd /workspace/task && python3 -c \"\nimport openpyxl\nwb=openpyxl.load_workbook('init.xlsx')\nws=wb.active\nfor r in range(4,8):\n    cols=['F','H','J','L','N']\n    parts=[f'IFERROR(VALUE({c}{r}),0)' for c in cols]\n    f='=SUM('+','.join(parts)+')'\n    ws['O'+str(r)]=f\nwb.save('output.xlsx')\nprint('done')\n\""},"tool_output":{"exitCode":0,"stderr":"","stdout":"done\n","truncated":false}}
